	(text "USB-C (5.1k Rd on CC1/CC2; CC voltages sensed by MCU ADC to budget LED current)\nBQ24073 power-path charger: ICHG=890/RISET=0.49A, ILIM=1550/RILIM=1.29A (EN2=1,EN1=0). Default USB500 (EN1 pulled to VBUS).\nRT9080 3.3V LDO enabled by power switch (VSYS) OR USB VBUS via BAT54C -> charges and runs wired with switch off.\nLED rail: TPS61023 boost (true disconnect) + TPS2116 mux. LED_PWR_EN low = LED rail fully off (no 0.6mA/LED idle drain).\n  USB present: TPS2116 feeds LEDs straight from VBUS (PR1 divider). Battery: from the 5V boost.\nQ1 gates the 61 TMR sensors (SENS_3V3, ~15 mA) so firmware can duty-cycle them on battery.\nBattery: 1S LiPo WITH protection PCM, JST-PH 2.0 (pin1 = +). CHECK polarity of your battery lead!"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
